&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#75715e">&lt;/span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">1.&lt;/span> 检查目录下已有文章，确认选题不重复
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">2.&lt;/span> 撰写文章，设置 draft: true
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">3.&lt;/span> 本地 &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">`~/bin/hugo --minify`&lt;/span> 构建验证
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef">4.&lt;/span> git add → git commit → git push
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>为什么它能稳定驱动一个每天 4 班的定时 agent？因为它满足下面五条。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>